   "sentenceId": 16,
   "he": "כֹּהֵן הַקָּרוֹב אֵצֶל הַמִּזְבֵּחַ וְכוּ׳. מַאן תָּנָא פֶּסַח בִּזְרִיקָה? אָמַר רַב חִסְדָּא: רַבִּי יוֹסֵי הַגְּלִילִי הִיא.",
   "en": "It was also stated in the mishna that «the priest who was closest to the altar» would sprinkle the blood upon the altar. «Who is the tanna» who holds that the blood of «the Paschal lamb» requires «sprinkling» from afar upon the altar, and that pouring the blood directly from the bowl onto the altar does not suffice? «Rav Ḥisda said: It is Rabbi Yosei HaGelili.»"
  }
